      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIONS EYES (1) savaged the line on debut from near last on the turn with an unlucky second over 1000m at this track with the 59kg. Gets a similar set-up for this and Zac Lloyd takes the reins. Hard to stop. LAUGHING MOONS (5) comes out of the same race as LIONS EYES after making her debut with a closing third over 1000m at this track. Sticky map today and looks to have further upside. Each-way. THREESOME (4) resumes from a very lengthy break. Tough ask on debut with a plugging sixth over 1100m in the G3 Golden Gift at Rosehill last November. Trialled up well for this and gelded over the break. Forward showing anticipated. REGAL (8) is a Bjorn Baker-trained three-year-old filly by King's Legacy from Lunar Tramp on debut. Has impressed in all her trials and is worthy of serious consideration.",
